body.zh:
因式分解，是把一個式子寫成幾個因式相乘。先找每一項都有的因式。
$6r^{2}$ 與 $4rs$ 都有 $2r$；提出後，分別留下 $3r$ 與 $2s$。{{math:0}}
把結果展開，檢查每一項能否回到原式。{{math:1}}

body.en:
Factorisation rewrites an expression as a product. Start with a factor shared by every term.
Both $6r^{2}$ and $4rs$ contain $2r$. Taking it out leaves $3r$ and $2s$.{{math:0}}
Expand the result and check that every term matches the original.{{math:1}}

body.zh:
四項式可以先嘗試分成兩組；目標是讓每組提出公因式後，留下相同的括號。
例：先把 $hk+1+h+k$ 調位，再分組。{{math:0}}
第二組其實是 $1(k+1)$，所以提出 $(k+1)$ 後，仍要留下 $+1$。
兩組相差負號時，可先提出 $-1$。{{math:1}}

body.en:
For four terms, try two pairs. Aim to leave the same bracket after taking out a common factor from each pair.
First rearrange $hk+1+h+k$, then group.{{math:0}}
The second group is $1(k+1)$, so taking out $(k+1)$ still leaves $+1$.
If the brackets have opposite signs, take out $-1$ first.{{math:1}}

body.zh:
兩項相減，而且每項都可寫成平方：用平方差。{{math:0}}
三項相加：首尾是平方，中間項必須是 $2uv$，才是完全平方。{{math:1}}
中間項是 $-2uv$ 時，括號內用減號。{{math:2}}
先辨認整個形狀，再把題目的數或式子放入 $u$、$v$。

body.en:
Two subtracted terms that are both squares: use the difference of two squares.{{math:0}}
For three terms, square terms at both ends are not enough: the middle term must be $2uv$.{{math:1}}
When the middle term is $-2uv$, use a minus in the bracket.{{math:2}}
Recognise the whole pattern, then substitute the given numbers or expressions for $u$ and $v$.

body.zh:
對二次三項式，先找兩個一次因式的候選。首項乘積與末項乘積都要對。
係數是 $1$ 的例子：$(-2)(-3)=6$，而 $(-2)+(-3)=-5$。{{math:0}}
係數不是 $1$ 時，要交叉相乘再相加。本例 $3x-10x=-7x$。{{math:1}}
首尾對、中間也對，才可以寫成這兩個因式。

body.en:
For a quadratic trinomial, choose two candidate linear factors. Their leading and constant products must match.
With leading coefficient $1$, $(-2)(-3)=6$ and $(-2)+(-3)=-5$.{{math:0}}
With a different leading coefficient, add the cross products. Here $3x-10x=-7x$.{{math:1}}
Accept the factor pair only when both ends and the middle term match.

body.zh:
尾兩項出現 $m-n$，可以提示我們試找這個因式；但仍要檢查其餘部分。
本例前三項也可寫成 $(m-n)(4m-3n)$，所以整式才有共同因式 $(m-n)$。{{math:0}}
最後展開檢查每一項，而非只看尾巴。{{math:1}}

body.en:
The last pair $m-n$ suggests trying this factor, but the rest of the expression must be checked too.
Here the first three terms also factor as $(m-n)(4m-3n)$, so the whole expression shares $(m-n)$.{{math:0}}
Expand and check every term, not just the tail.{{math:1}}

body.zh:
四項可以分成兩對，分別提出公因式。{{math:0}}
若兩個括號剛好相差負號，先把負號整理好。{{math:1}}
六項可試三組、每組兩項，或兩組、每組三項。分法不只一種，目標都是留下共同因式。

body.en:
Four terms can be grouped into two pairs, each with its own common factor.{{math:0}}
If the brackets have opposite signs, deal with the minus first.{{math:1}}
For six terms, try three pairs or two groups of three. Different groupings can work; the goal is a common factor.

body.zh:
這組題目練習把前一小題的結果用在後一小題。若題目寫 Hence，更要清楚展示這個連接。
例：前一部得到 $xy(x+3y)$，餘下兩項又可寫成 $2(x+3y)$。{{math:0}}
圈起兩處相同的 $(x+3y)$，提出後，把餘下的 $xy$ 與 $2$ 相加。

body.en:
These questions practise reusing an earlier result. When the instruction says Hence, show that connection explicitly.
Suppose the earlier result is $xy(x+3y)$ and the remaining pair is $2(x+3y)$.{{math:0}}
Identify both copies of $(x+3y)$, take it out and add the remaining $xy$ and $2$.

body.zh:
先找出哪些項與前一小題相同，或剛好相差一個負號。
把後三項當成一整組：{{math:0}}
用前一部的分解結果，再提出相同括號。{{math:1}}
最後一個減號仍然作用於整個 $(2m-3n)$，所以化簡時是 $-2m+3n$。

body.en:
Find the terms that match the earlier part, possibly with every sign reversed.
Treat the last three terms as one group.{{math:0}}
Use the earlier factorisation and take out the common bracket.{{math:1}}
The last minus applies to all of $(2m-3n)$, giving $-2m+3n$.

body.zh:
這一組先把六項分成兩組，令相同括號出現。{{math:0}}
提出 $(x+y+5)$ 後，餘下的 $x^{2}-1$ 仍是平方差。{{math:1}}
完成之前，逐個因式檢查：有沒有公因式，或仍可套用恆等式？

body.en:
In this set, group the six terms so a shared bracket appears.{{math:0}}
After taking out $(x+y+5)$, the remaining $x^{2}-1$ is still a difference of squares.{{math:1}}
Before finishing, check every factor for another common factor or identity.

body.zh:
多部題可以先找前兩部相同的因式，再用於最後一部。{{math:0}}
另一類題先把三項變成完全平方，再套用平方差。{{math:1}}
在 $U^{2}-V^{2}$ 中，$U$、$V$ 可以各自是一整個式子；先寫 $(U+V)(U-V)$，再化簡。

body.en:
In a multipart question, find a factor shared by the earlier results and reuse it in the final part.{{math:0}}
Another pattern turns three terms into a perfect square before using the difference of squares.{{math:1}}
In $U^{2}-V^{2}$, both $U$ and $V$ may be whole expressions. Write $(U+V)(U-V)$ before simplifying.

There is more than one way to solve a quadratic equation — factorisation, the quadratic formula, completing the square, or cancelling when both sides share the same factor. This lesson focuses on the three most useful:
(1) factorisation (find the roots with the calculator, then work back to the factors) — no need to force the cross-method;
(2) a factor on both sides: take it $=0$ first for one root, then cancel it for the other root;
(3) the quadratic formula $x=\frac{-b\pm\sqrt{b^{2}-4ac}}{2a}$ — for surd roots or awkward coefficients.
Method 1 (calculator factorisation): on a Casio fx-50FH II press [FMLA 01] (or run Prog 1 on a fx-3650P II) and enter $a$, $b$, $c$ to get the two roots. Reverse rule: a fraction root $x=\frac{p}{q}$ gives the factor $(qx-p)$; an integer root $x=k$ gives $(x-k)$:
{{math:0}}
Method 2 (a factor on both sides): split it into two cases and no root is lost —
(a) first assume that common factor $=0$: it always satisfies the equation (both sides become 0), so you get one root straight away;
(b) for everything else (the factor is $\ne 0$), you may cancel it and solve the remaining linear equation — that gives the other root.
✗ Wrong (cancelling $x$ without splitting the cases): this leaves only $x=-8$ and loses $x=0${{math:1}}
✓ Right (split the cases first): {{math:2}}
Example: solve $(x-2t)(x-3t)=(6t-x)(x-3t)$ — take $(x-3t)=0$ to get $x=3t$; in the other case cancel $(x-3t)$ to get $2x-8t=0$, i.e. $x=4t$ — both roots kept.
(Moving everything to one side and factoring gives exactly the same roots; both routes are acceptable, so use whichever you are steadier at.)
Method 3 (quadratic formula): use it when factorisation is not clean (surd roots): {{math:3}}
Finally: whichever method you use, always write every root (both sides of “or”).

body.zh:
卷二最愛考這種題：已知一個根，要求另一條式子的值 —— 做法通常是兩步：① 寫下 $a\alpha^{2}+b\alpha+c=0$；② 把方程整理成「$\alpha^{2}=$（一條含有 $\alpha$ 的式子）」，再整塊代入目標式：那個式子是分數也可以 —— 分子整塊乘，約簡時每一項都要除。
例：已知 $\alpha$ 是方程 $x^{2}-4x-2=0$ 的一個根，求 $3+8\alpha-2\alpha^{2}$ 的值。{{math:0}}
不需要求出 $\alpha$ 的數值（它通常是無理數）；用「根」這個關係就夠。
另一個例子：已知 $\beta$ 是方程 $3\beta^{2}-5\beta-7=0$ 的一個根，求 $4+10\beta-6\beta^{2}$ 的值。{{math:1}}

body.en:
A Paper 2 favourite: given one root, find the value of another expression — usually two steps: (1) write down $a\alpha^{2}+b\alpha+c=0$; (2) rearrange the equation into $\alpha^{2}=$ (an expression in $\alpha$), then substitute that whole expression into the target; a fraction is fine — multiply the whole numerator, and divide every term when cancelling.
Example: given that $\alpha$ is a root of $x^{2}-4x-2=0$, find the value of $3+8\alpha-2\alpha^{2}$. {{math:0}}
You do not need the value of $\alpha$ itself (it is usually irrational); the root relation is enough.
Another example: given that $\beta$ is a root of $3\beta^{2}-5\beta-7=0$, find the value of $4+10\beta-6\beta^{2}$. {{math:1}}

